Asset Realization Agent

Responsible for transforming identified assets into recoverable value through sale, lease, securitization, or settlement. It evaluates disposal routes (auction, direct sale, strategic investor, etc.), simulates expected recovery under each option, and coordinates workflows between valuers, auctioneers, and creditors to maximize realization proceeds.";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1762874138;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1762874138;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:79:"rbz_agents:insolvency_agents:asset_management:asset_discovery:asset_realization";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:503;s:9:"timestamp";i:1762874138;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}